Behavioral AI (behavioralai) is a universal, zero-runtime-dependency
library and CLI for
behavioral observability of Massive Intelligence (IM) agents and non-human
entities (NHE): per-agent behavioral fingerprinting, real-time drift
detection, attribution, trend forecasting, and multi-channel alerting.

