----------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Behavioral AI has ZERO required runtime dependencies. The sibling-package
adapters under @takk/behavioralai/integrations use OPTIONAL peer
dependencies, resolved only when the consumer constructs them. Each is
distributed under its own license:

  - @takk/keymesh (Takk Innovate Studio)    - Apache-2.0
  - @takk/modelchain (Takk Innovate Studio) - Apache-2.0

The core package, the alert channels, the OpenTelemetry ingestion mapper,
the SMTP email channel, and the CLI use only the runtime's built-in fetch,
WebCrypto, and the Node standard library; they pull in none of the above.

Development-only tooling (NOT shipped in the published package):

  - tsup            - MIT
  - vitest          - MIT
  - typescript      - Apache-2.0
  - @biomejs/biome  - MIT OR Apache-2.0
  - publint         - MIT
